[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Fine day]
[00:00.80]Lesson 33 | 第33课
[00:02.73]A fine day | 美好的一天
[00:05.39]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.86]Where is the Jones family? | 琼斯一家在哪里？
[00:15.20]It is a fine day today. | 今天天气很好。
[00:19.52]There are some clouds in the sky, | 天空中有些云，
[00:23.61]but the sun is shining. | 但是阳光普照。
[00:27.08]Mr. Jones is with his family. | 琼斯先生和家人在一起。
[00:31.52]They are walking over the bridge. | 他们正走过桥。
[00:35.50]There are some boats on the river. | 河上有一些船。
[00:39.31]Mr. Jones and his wife are looking at them. | 琼斯先生和他的妻子正在看它们。
[00:45.53]Sally is looking at a big ship. | 萨莉正在看一艘大船。
[00:49.84]The ship is going under the bridge. | 船正在从桥下穿过。
[00:53.94]Tim is looking at an aeroplane. | 蒂姆正在看一架飞机。
[00:58.64]The aeroplane is flying over the river. | 飞机正在河上空飞过。